Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ub: udma: bugfix related to log print

driver inclusion
category: bugfix
bugzilla: https://gitee.com/openeuler/kernel/issues/IDAYM3
CVE: NA

-----------------------------------------------------------

This patch fix a bug about log print

Signed-off-by: Liang Zhang <zhangliang296@h-partners.com>
---
 src/urma/hw/udma/udma_u_ctl.c   | 24 ++++++++++--------------
